# Emoji shortcodes ✨

termd is fast ⚡ and tested ✅, and a long paragraph with 🚀 wraps at every
width of the golden files like any other text 🎉.

• Tables 📊
• Diagrams 🎨
• Bold 🔥 and italic ⭐

